ust need time to recover, for example while queued work or retries clear. But it could also mean v5.1.0 has its own problem, separate from the worker. I haven't touched it.\n\nIf its error rate hasn't started to drop within a few minutes, you could roll `payments-api` back to v5.0.0, its last healthy release. That needs no approval. Tell me if you want me to do it, or to add this to INC-0001.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01DHHpBiG3ozHzK3wHr914LY", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payments", "confidence": 0.85}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_012L9y9GdQv4UtBYFgk4GEEx", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payments", "confidence": 0.85}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01Hs6jokhKeXNbFSGzSYddmq", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"confidence": 0.8}, "name": "list_incidents", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01JbH56tWUp1md9p92TG3aA1", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payments-api", "confidence": 0.6}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01LG2EZAyXyb4JqrKgzXsDGw", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payments-service", "confidence": 0.5}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01SD1QNZrgCKxm5jDnwEnQnu", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payments-api", "confidence": 0.9}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01Ap6MnAoDazLZfb5Dmn5f3N", "caller": {"type": "direct"},